- Be bold. Try ambitious refactors, experimental approaches, or creative solutions. The Synthesizer will filter for quality.\"\n\nWait!\nLook at Requirement 1 in the user prompt:\n\"1. Replace sorry in ex\n<truncated 973 bytes>\nit!\nCan we provide a complete proof of `prove_e20263a9`?\nLet's think: Is it possible to prove `prove_e20263a9` in Lean 4?\nLet's see what is involved.\nLet's analyze what lemmas we need:\nGoal: `GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G`.\nRecall:\n`GraphCalc.radius G = ((univ.image (eccentricity G)).min).getD 0`.\n`GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G = (((univ.filter (IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image romanWeight).min).getD 0`.\n\nWait!\nLet's check if there is ANY case where `GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G` can be simplified:\nCan we show:\nFor any $f : V \\to \\text{Fin } 3$ such that `IsRomanDominatingFunction G f`:\n`GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ romanWeight f`?\nIf we prove that for ANY $f$ satisfying `IsRomanDominatingFunction G f`,\n`GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ romanWeight f`,\nTHEN:\nBy definition of `romanDominationNumber G`:\n`romanDominationNumber G = min {romanWeight f | IsRomanDominatingFunction G f}`.\nSince `GraphCalc.radius G + 1` is $\\le \\text{romanWeight } f$ for ALL $f$ in the set,\nand the set is nonempty (constant 2 works),\n`GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ romanDominationNumber G`!\n\nLOOK AT THAT!\nWe do NOT need to construct the minimum Roman dominating function!\nWe just need:\nFor ANY $f : V \\to \\text{Fin } 3$ such that `GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f`:\n`GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f`!\n\nLet's verify this step in Lean:\nIf `∀ f, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f → GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f`,\ndoes `GraphCalc.radius G + 1 ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G` follow?\nYES!\nBecause `romanDominationNumber G` is `((S.image romanWeight).min).getD 0`.\nLet's prove this reduction lemma in Lean!\nLet's test this lemma right now in Lean:\n```lean\nlemma le_romanDominationNumber (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ)\n    (h : ∀ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f → k ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f) :\n    k ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G\n```\nLet's test if we can prove this lemma in Lean!","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"bash -c '\\nENVF=\\\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/.agf_env\\\"\\nexport ELAN_HOME=\\\"$(grep -m1 \\\"^AGF_ELAN_HOME=\\\" \\\"$ENVF\\\" | cut -d= -f2-)\\\"\\nLEAN=\\\"$ELAN_HOME/bin/lean\\\"\\nexport LEAN_PATH=\\\"$(cat /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/.agf_lean_path)\\\"\\n\\ncat << \\\"EOF\\\" > /tmp/test_lemma2.lean\\nimport Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\n\\nlemma le_romanDominationNumber {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ)\\n    (h : ∀ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f → k ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f) :\\n    k ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber\\n  have h_ex : ∃ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f := by\\n    use (fun _ => 2)\\n    intro v hv\\n    dsimp at hv\\n    revert hv\\n    decide\\n  rcases h_ex with ⟨f₀, hf₀⟩\\n  have h_mem : GraphCalc.romanWeight f₀ ∈ (Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image GraphCalc.romanWeight := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_image]\\n    exact ⟨f₀, Finset.mem_filter.mpr ⟨Finset.mem_univ f₀, hf₀⟩, rfl⟩\\n  have h_nonempty : ((Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image GraphCalc.romanWeight).Nonempty :=\\n    ⟨GraphCalc.romanWeight f₀, h_mem⟩\\n  obtain ⟨m, hm⟩ := Finset.min_of_nonempty h_nonempty\\n  rw [hm]\\n  dsimp\\n  have hm_in := Finset.mem_of_min hm\\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hm_in\\n  rcases hm_in with ⟨f_min, hf_min, rfl⟩\\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hf_min\\n  exact h f_min hf_min.2\\n\\nEOF\\n\\n\\\"$LEAN\\\" /tmp/test_lemma2.lean\\necho \\\"Exit: $?\\\"\\n'\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Test le_romanDominationNumber lemma\"","toolSummary":"\"Test le_romanDominationNumber in Lean\""}}],"truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":249,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:04:50Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T17:04:50+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: dcc102cf-facd-4d9b-8d91-c684bfca7058/task-249\nTask Description: bash -c '\nENVF=\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/.agf_env\"\nexport ELAN_HOME=\"$(grep -m1 \"^AGF_ELAN_HOME=\" \"$ENVF\" | cut -d= -f2-)\"\nLEAN=\"$ELAN_HOME/bin/lean\"\nexport LEAN_PATH=\"$(cat /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/.agf_lean_path)\"\n\ncat << \"EOF\" > /tmp/test_lemma2.lean\nimport Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nopen SimpleGraph\n\nlemma le_romanDominationNumber {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ)\n    (h : ∀ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f → k ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f) :\n    k ≤ GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G := by\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber\n  have h_ex : ∃ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f := by\n    use (fun _ => 2)\n    intro v hv\n    dsimp at hv\n    revert hv\n    decide\n  rcases h_ex with ⟨f₀, hf₀⟩\n  have h_mem : GraphCalc.romanWeight f₀ ∈ (Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image GraphCalc.romanWeight := by\n    rw [Finset.mem_image]\n    exact ⟨f₀, Finset.mem_filter.mpr ⟨Finset.mem_univ f₀, hf₀⟩, rfl⟩\n  have h_nonempty : ((Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image GraphCalc.romanWeight).Nonempty :=\n    ⟨GraphCalc.romanWeight f₀, h_mem⟩\n  obtain ⟨m, hm⟩ := Finset.min_of_nonempty h_nonempty\n  rw [hm]\n  dsimp\n  have hm_in := Finset.mem_of_min hm\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hm_in\n  rcases hm_in with ⟨f_min, hf_min, rfl⟩\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hf_min\n  exact h f_min hf_min.2\n\nEOF\n\n\"$LEAN\" /tmp/test_lemma2.lean\necho \"Exit: $?\"\n'\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/dcc102